@host = http://localhost:5183

### Dashboard (HTML)
GET {{host}}/
Accept: text/html

### Book page (HTML)
GET {{host}}/Home/Book
Accept: text/html

### API — all appointments (JSON)
GET {{host}}/api/appointments
Accept: application/json

### API — slots by date
GET {{host}}/api/slots?date=2025-01-15
Accept: application/json